    descriptionAdvancedEn: "Palić Lake, situated near Subotica, serves as a historic resort with a bohemian charm, renowned for its elegant Art Nouveau architecture and immaculately landscaped parks. The lake itself possesses therapeutic properties, while the surrounding environment offers a wide range of activities, from relaxing walks along the shoreline to visits at the local zoo. It remains an ideal location for holidays, seamlessly combining relaxation with architectural exploration. Arts K7 — lake-side resorts and Art Nouveau design.",
